AI Tavern Lite database migrations
==================================

The application upgrades the configured database to Alembic head during
startup.  The first revision can adopt an existing unversioned SQLite database
without recreating user tables.

Common commands (run from the backend directory):

    .venv\Scripts\python.exe -m alembic current
    .venv\Scripts\python.exe -m alembic history
    .venv\Scripts\python.exe -m alembic heads

Use the project-level scripts\database-migrate.ps1 wrapper for a backed-up
manual upgrade.  Do not run `alembic downgrade base`; the baseline downgrade is
intentionally blocked because it would delete all user data.
